{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、\n『THEドラえもん展TOKYO』に行ってきました!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのクリエイターさんが\n思い思いのドラえもんを表現していらして、\nかっこよくて面白くて\nなるほどな〜と驚くものばかりでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラえもんって凄いなー。\nのび太くんの\n一生懸命で優しい姿がすごく大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや〜本当に痺れました!\n何時間でもいれる空間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬休み期間も開催してるみたいなので、是非〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJPNVHBEVDVMF3FQMCCJWG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いTシャツも買ったけん、\n今度着たとき写真載せますね〜( ˶ˆᴗˆ˶ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近くだったので、\n東京タワーにも行ってきました!\nちなみに初めて登ってきました!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJPPS0EDVTKA67XHZJHBD7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいいな〜。東京タワー大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJPQR325ZFGGMJPPNNKQE7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日の有線音楽優秀賞の授賞式で、こんなに素敵なメダルを頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将来自分が歳を重ねたときにこのメダルを見て、欅坂46だったんだなってしみじみするんだろうなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に宝物です。ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJPRPA1P5A8FRNC96PHK3D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音符ヘア。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"只今、写真集公式Twitterで長濱ねる50音チャレンジという企画をしてます( ◜࿀◝ )\nhttps://mobile.twitter.com/neru_nagasaki"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宜しければ〜( °_° )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お読みいただきありがとうございます。長濱ねる"}],"source":"archive"}